        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Preclusion",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) To avoid any doubt, it is declared that even though another law of the Commonwealth (including other provisions of this Act) provides power to do one or more of the things referred to in subsection (1),"
    },
    {
