    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zc-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...unless the constable believes on reasonable grounds that doing that thing is necessary to protect life or to prevent serious injury to another person",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal relation between prohibited action and necessity",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Without limiting the operation of subsection (1), a constable must not, in the course of arresting a person for an offence:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zc-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "unless necessary to protect life.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of using force to cause harm",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "forbid",
      "cml:premiseText": "Constable must not use force."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zc-ss-2-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...unless:  (i) the constable believes on reasonable grounds that doing that thing is necessary to protect life or to prevent serious injury to another person (including the constable); and",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of using force to cause harm during escape",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "forbid",
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) if the person is attempting to escape arrest by fleeing—do such a thing unless:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zc-ss-2-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...unless the constable believes on reasonable grounds that doing that thing is necessary to protect life or to prevent serious injury to another person",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
